--- If ALL crude RBO diverted to fuel (NOT recommended, burns edible oil) ---
  100% bran, whole RBO->biodiesel: 169 cr L = B1.5  (absurd: displaces cooking oil India imports)

--- To reach B1 / B5 from the WHOLE realistic non-edible waste basket ---
  rice acid oil 1.57 + UCO 4.0 + tallow 1.5 = 7.1 LMT lipid
  -> 76 cr L biodiesel = B0.69  (still < B1)
  B5 needs ~549 cr L biodiesel = ~51 LMT of oil feedstock
    = ~1/3 of India's entire ~250 LMT edible-oil supply. Physically impossible from waste alone.

--- Husk (energy lever, does NOT blend into diesel) ---
  183.0 LMT husk -> ~9,150 GWh/yr potential (power the extraction/esterification + grid/silica)
  Husk role = process-energy self-sufficiency + carbon credit, not a blend component.
